# Deviations from METHOD.md

**D1 (2026-10-20, before any Hono result):** run.py read Hono's `gold_lines` with `ast.literal_eval`, but
questions.json already stores them as JSON objects, so the Hono set stopped at its first question with a ValueError.
Fixed to read them as they are. No other set was affected (Graphify and claude-mem take their lines from git, and
Django has none). Nothing was recorded for Hono before the fix.
